## 2. Validation of the Proposed Piecewise Soft-Knee Limiter

### 2.1 Definition (with H = 50, T = 40, R = 10)

```
T = 0.8·H = 40      (knee threshold)
R = H − T  = 10     (soft-zone width)
g(x) = | x                          , if |x| ≤ T
       | T + R·tanh((|x|−T)/R)      , if |x| > T
```

### 2.2 Requested sample points

