|----------|--------|-------------|-----------|
| 39 | linear | 39 | **39.000** |
| 40 | linear (`>` strict, 40 ≯ 40) | 40 | **40.000** |
| 41 | tanh | `40 + 10·tanh(1/10)` = `40 + 10·tanh(0.1)` = `40 + 10·0.099668` | **40.997** |
